-- Interpretation --------------------------------------------
   Rounds 1-3: deterministic relations are expected in ANY Feistel
   network -- after r rounds one half is a known function of the
   input halves. They are not an attack.
   What matters is the first round where NO deviation exceeds the
   noise floor, and how much margin the full 16 rounds leave.

